 "title": "Why Deer Really Freeze in Headlights #shorts",
 "description": "Deer in the headlights look terrified, but fear probably isn't the reason they stop. Their amazing night vision is what turns against them.\n\nFollow for what's trending, explained!\n\n#deer #animals #nature #science #shorts",
