 "lines": [
  {
   "say": "A deer freezing in your headlights looks terrified. But it probably isn't fear.",
   "clip_id": 256065,
   "inset_id": 312758,
   "inset_x": 0.68,
   "inset_y": 0.46,
   "inset_delay": 0.4,
   "inset_tilt": 6,
   "punch": "NOT FEAR",
   "punch_y": 0.66,
   "punch_delay": 3.2,
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/2960d6c10936ce72.mp4",
   "inset_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/c982ca3662160a4b.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "The best explanation is that, for a few seconds, the deer simply cannot see.",
   "clip_id": 304819,
   "punch": "CAN'T SEE",
   "punch_y": 0.66,
   "punch_delay": 3.0,
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/8c77b6babf25999a.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "Deer are built for dawn and dusk, when light is scarce.",
   "clip_id": 323450,
   "items": [
    {
     "emoji": "🌅",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.36,
     "size": 0.2,
     "anim": "pop",
     "delay": 0.4
    }
   ],
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/d47eb753fcce39f3.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "Their wide pupils gather much more light than yours.",
   "clip_id": 102917,
   "items": [
    {
     "emoji": "👁️",
     "x": 0.3,
     "y": 0.38,
     "size": 0.17,
     "anim": "pop",
     "delay": 0.4
    }
   ],
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/8569625d045d5435.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "Their eyes are packed with rods, the cells that work in dim light.",
   "clip_id": 159318,
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/fba27bbad7e4f8cc.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "And behind the retina sits a mirror like layer. Light bounces back, so the eye uses it twice.",
   "clip_id": 190280,
   "number": {
    "value": 2,
    "suffix": "x",
    "label": "SAME LIGHT, USED TWICE",
    "y": 0.5
   },
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/8a8671291d747e03.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "At twilight, deer see about 18 times better than you do.",
   "clip_id": 133684,
   "number": {
    "value": 18,
    "suffix": "x",
    "label": "BETTER AT TWILIGHT",
    "y": 0.5
   },
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/4a2a7e6dc6e22dc0.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "Now add a car. Bright headlights hit eyes that are wide open.",
   "clip_id": 370404,
   "items": [
    {
     "emoji": "🚗",
     "x": 0.5,
     "y": 0.36,
     "size": 0.2,
     "anim": "zoom",
     "delay": 0.4
    }
   ],
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/7fcab81810594c9b.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "All that light floods the rods at once. It is called flash blindness.",
   "clip_id": 1042,
   "punch": "FLASH BLINDNESS",
   "punch_y": 0.64,
   "punch_delay": 2.8,
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/5ad89c35cc482369.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "The light sensing pigment breaks down, and it rebuilds slowly.",
   "clip_id": 6456,
   "inset_id": 92653,
   "inset_x": 0.5,
   "inset_y": 0.42,
   "inset_delay": 0.5,
   "inset_tilt": -5,
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/63065328882d643e.mp4",
   "inset_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/65037ea0b35c1cc9.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "So the road, the car, and every way out just vanish.",
   "clip_id": 254449,
   "punch": "GONE",
   "punch_y": 0.64,
   "punch_delay": 2.2,
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/36bfd6a8c9847fac.mp4"
  },
  {
   "say": "The deer stops, because it has no idea where to run.",
   "clip_id": 13023,
   "punch": "NOWHERE TO RUN",
   "punch_y": 0.66,
   "punch_delay": 1.6,
   "clip_path": "/root/.cache/shorts_clips/31ce09b010dea5f9.mp4"
  },
  {
